n最後連結帳也需要等待一下，\n我還是覺得值得推薦這家！",null,[0,38]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12222784292421054178/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTNMVXhoWkcxblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12222784292421054178/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTNMVXhoWkcxblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12222784292421054178/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTNMVXhoWkcxblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12222784292421054178/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTNMVXhoWkcxblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12222784292421054178/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTNMVXhoWkcxblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12222784292421054178/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTTNMVXhoWkcxblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,10974,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3LUxhZG1nRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x81878671580d8ab0!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC7-LadmgE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3LUxhZG1nRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3LUxhZG1nRRIsChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM3LUxhZFdnEhJDZ3NJLXZEbnRRWVE4TDJWSVEaLQoXQ0lITTBvZ0tFSUNBZ0lDNy1MYWQyZ0USEkNnc0ktdkRudFFZUThMMlZJUSISCQAAAAAAAAAAEbCKDVhxhoeBKgswYWlVV3UzOEt2aw\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiv8uOS8dSWAxWgU_UHHXf9H_8QoykIugEoDg"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],"0ahUKEwiZ5uiS8dSWAxUticAFHSdxKRQQ0pMFCFsoBw"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiv8uOS8dSWAxWgU_UHHXf9H_8Q0pMFCKEBKAc"]],null,null,null,"other_user_google_review_posts__and__hotel_and_vr_partner_review_posts",null,"CjEIARIpCgoAP7_LAOT0____EhD6Or-i-m4hj0EZRJEAAAAAGgn92RICbrmNYyoYACIA"]],null,null,null,[3,1,null,null,null,[2]]],null,null,null,nu